Package: nacta-passport
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0, libblkid1, liblzma5, libstdc++6, libgl1
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Maintainer: Nacta паспорт <nacta-passport@local>
Description: Local Russian passport OCR desktop app
 Nacta паспорт recognises Russian internal passport pages on this computer.
 Images and personal data never leave the machine. The package bundles the
 Flutter client, Python 3.12, PaddleOCR/RussianDocsOCR and model weights.
 Requires Ubuntu/Debian amd64 with glibc from Ubuntu 22.04 or newer.
